# Goal
std_msgs/Header header
string task_id
uint8 gripper_id
uint8[] position     # 改为动态数组，或在代码中确保传入长度为2
uint8[] speed
uint8[] max_torque
uint8[] com_port
bool block_until_complete
int64 timeout_ms

---
# Result
bool success
uint8[] final_position
uint8[] final_torque
string error_message

---
# Feedback
uint8[] current_position
uint8[] current_torque
uint8[] current_speed
float32 progress_rate
std_msgs/Header header
